OL,3,GNEWSAMy dream of being a paramedic
OL,4,Ahelped me save a life at 15
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen aspiring paramedic Ethan ordered
OL,7,Fthree resuscitation manikins so he
OL,8,Fcould teach CPR to others, he had no
OL,9,Fidea how quickly he would put his
OL,10,Ftraining into practice and help save a
OL,11,Flife.
OL,13,FJust two weeks after the dummies
OL,14,Farrived at his home in Mansfield
OL,15,FWoodhouse, in Nottinghamshire, the
OL,16,F15-year-old found himself performing
OL,17,FCPR on a man he found collapsed in the
OL,18,Fstreet.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
