OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1792387603
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMy dream of being a paramedic
OL,4,Ahelped me save a life at 15
OL,5,
OL,6,FEthan, who had completed a one-off CPR
OL,7,Fcourse with East Midlands Ambulance
OL,8,FService (EMAS) last year, said he went
OL,9,Fthrough "a million and one emotions" as
OL,10,Fhe realised he was about to apply his
OL,11,Fknowledge to a real-life emergency.
OL,13,F"It was adrenaline like never before,
OL,14,Fbut I knew I had to stay calm, and not
OL,15,Fthink too hard about the immense
OL,16,Fpressure of putting someone's life in
OL,17,Fyour hands," he added.
